          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="faq-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-2" hidden>
          <p>Feeding needs vary based on age, weight, activity level, and food type. Start with the food packaging guidance, split meals into regular portions, and ask a veterinarian for a plan tailored to your cat.</p>
        </div>
