        </button>
        <div class="details" id="faq-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-button-5" hidden>
          <p>Most healthy adult cats should have a wellness exam once a year, while kittens, senior cats, and pets with medical conditions may need more frequent visits to stay current on vaccines and preventive care.</p>
